# These files are append-only lists (check-suite registrations, ownership table
# rows) where a merge of two independent branches almost always wants both
# sides' additions rather than a conflict. `merge=union` keeps every line
# added by either side instead of forcing manual resolution.
#
# Caveat: union merge cannot tell an intentional removal or reorder from a
# line that "disappeared" because the other side didn't have it. If your
# change removes or reorders entries in one of these files, review the merge
# result by hand — union merge will silently keep a line you meant to delete.
Sources/AuralChecks/AuralChecksMain.swift merge=union
Sources/AuralChecks/DeferredBoundaryChecks/BoundaryTests.swift merge=union
docs/playback-engine-ownership.md merge=union
